{
  "key": 18211,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Have you visited Pewter Gym?\r",
        "The Gym Leader uses\n",
        "Rock-type Pokémon."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "At night, CLEFAIRY come out to play\n",
        "at Mt. Moon.\r",
        "But not every night."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, you came all the way out here\n",
        "from Johto?\r",
        "That brings back memories.\r",
        "When I was young, I went to Johto\n",
        "to train.\r",
        "You remind me so much of what I was\n",
        "like as a young man.\r",
        "Here. I want you to have this item\n",
        "I found in Johto.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00003",
      "garbage": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00004",
      "garbage": 22
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Going to new, unknown places and\n",
        "seeing new people...\f",
        "Those are the joys of travel."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: It seems that LATIOS became\n",
        "attracted to it in no time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: It seems that LATIAS became\n",
        "attracted to it in no time!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "I can feel that LATIOS is full of\n",
        "fighting spirit!\r",
        "I would love to challenge it,\n",
        "but I will let you go for it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "I can feel that LATIAS is full of\n",
        "fighting spirit!\r",
        "I would love to challenge it,\n",
        "but I will let you go for it!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00010",
      "en_US": "LATIOS: Shuaaaann!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00011",
      "en_US": "LATIAS: Huaaaaann!\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00012",
      "en_US": "LATIOS flew away to the distant sky...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00013",
      "en_US": "LATIAS flew away to the distant sky...\r"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: Impressive!\n",
        "It was a great battle!\r",
        "I don’t think you had to give\n",
        "everything you’ve got,\f",
        "and that scares me...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "I’ve been away from the Hoenn\n",
        "Pokémon League for too long.\r",
        "I’ll have to excuse myself.\r",
        "..................\r",
        "Oh, I never got your name.\f",
        "...But I won’t ask for it this time.\r",
        "Our fun will have to wait for the\n",
        "right time.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: Impressive!\n",
        "It was a great battle!\r",
        "LATIOS will be back once it recovers\n",
        "to make amends for the defeat.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: Impressive!\n",
        "It was a great battle!\r",
        "LATIAS will be back once it recovers\n",
        "to make amends for the defeat.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: I see.\n",
        "You’d rather hide your true strength\f",
        "from me. You have room to breathe,\f",
        "and that scares me.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00019",
      "en_US": [
        "Steven: What? You are not scared,\n",
        "are you? Don’t be reserved. Go for it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00020",
      "en_US": [
        "Pewter City\n",
        "Between Rugged Mountains"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0460_T03_00021",
      "en_US": [
